requirements_section:
MSc/PhD in computer science, Machine Learning, or related technical field:
Relevant programming skills in Python with a variety of Deep Learning tasks and experience with libraries like PyTorch;
Expertise in one or more of the following cloud providers: Google Cloud Platform, AWS, Azure;
Relevant experience in independently completing complex technical projects;
Comprehensive understanding of the Computer Vision landscape & toolkits;
You appreciate sound engineering practices like version control, clean code, code review, testing, CI/CD, and automation;
Ability to interact with clients, to understand their problems, and to design as well as to explain complex technical solutions;
Fluency in English.
Nice to have: German proficiency (minimum B1 level)
